  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Mix the quinoa flour, chickpea flour, and water in a bowl until well combined.",
    "Knead the dough for 5 minutes until it becomes pliable and smooth.",
    "Transfer the dough to a greased bowl and cover it with a damp cloth.",
    "Let it rest for 30 minutes.",
    "Divide the dough into 4 equal parts.",
    "Roll out each part into a thin circle, about 1/8 inch thick.",
    "Brush the surface of each circle with olive oil.",
    "Place the dough circles in a greased oven-safe bowl or individual ramekins.",
    "Bake for 15-20 minutes, or until the dough is golden brown and puffed.",
    "Top with kalamata olives, artichoke hearts, feta cheese, glace cherry, nuka-pickle, and fresh parsley.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
  ],
